{"title":"Skarnwing","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 61 Frost Dragon that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skarnwing\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skarnwing?lv=61\">Lv 61</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/skarnwing?lv=64\">Lv 64 <span>23</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/skarnwing?lv=61\" title=\"Pick level 61\"><td><b>61</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>462</td><td>38.1</td><td>3,050</td><td class=\"muted\">1,386 · 53.3 · 9,150</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/skarnwing\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>64</b></td><td>483</td><td>39.7</td><td>3,200</td><td class=\"muted\">1,449 · 55.6 · 9,600</td><td>23</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Frostfang&#39;s Eyrie</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 23</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"6501\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Frost Dragon: <a href=\"#/monster/frost-drake\">Frost Drake</a> <span class=\"muted\">(59)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/frost-dragon\">Frost Dragon</a> <span class=\"muted\">(61)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/elder-frost-dragon\">Elder Frost Dragon</a> <span class=\"muted\">(62)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/mother-hvit\">Mother Hvit</a> <span class=\"muted\">(63)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ysgar\">Ysgar the Elder</a> <span class=\"muted\">(64)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/frostfang\">Frostfang</a> <span class=\"muted\">(66)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/72d6ea37ea311fc96583.svg\" alt=\"Skarnwing\"></div><h3>Skarnwing</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>64</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 61)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Frost Dragon</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>483</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>39.7</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>3,200</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.0 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>2.05</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (10 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>1 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}